WEBVTT

00:00:10.315 --> 00:00:14.275
[ TOILET FLUSHES ]

00:00:16.408 --> 00:00:18.932
Ron:
WE FLUSH OURSELVES IN.

00:00:18.976 --> 00:00:20.804
[ DOORS CREAKING ]

00:00:20.847 --> 00:00:22.893
[ TOILET FLUSHES ]

00:00:22.936 --> 00:00:25.330
THAT'S BLOODY DISGUSTING.

00:00:30.814 --> 00:00:32.511
[ WATER SLOSHES ]

00:00:32.554 --> 00:00:34.469
[ KNOCK ON DOOR ]

00:00:34.513 --> 00:00:36.602
[ TOILETS FLUSHING ]

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:43.478
[ INDISTINCT TALKING ]

00:00:56.187 --> 00:00:58.537
Guard #1:
YOU -- COME ON.

00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:00.626
Man: WHAT? WHAT?Guard #2: COME ON.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:02.367
WHAT DID I DO?JUST KEEP WALKING.

00:01:10.114 --> 00:01:12.638
Harry: ARE THOSE...Hermione: MUGGLES.

00:01:12.682 --> 00:01:14.292
[ Voice breaking ]
IN THEIR...

00:01:14.335 --> 00:01:17.861
RIGHTFUL PLACE.

00:01:17.904 --> 00:01:21.691
GOT TO TELL YOU,
I'M STARTING TO FREAK OUT A BIT.

00:01:23.997 --> 00:01:27.131
HOW LONG DID YOU SAY
THIS BATCH OF POLYJUICE

00:01:27.174 --> 00:01:28.741
WOULD LAST, HERMIONE?

00:01:28.785 --> 00:01:30.395
I DIDN'T.

00:01:30.438 --> 00:01:31.875
[ ELEVATOR DINGS ]

00:01:31.918 --> 00:01:33.615
[ ELEVATOR DOOR OPENS ]

00:01:36.923 --> 00:01:39.796
CATTERMOLE...

00:01:39.839 --> 00:01:42.755
IT'S STILL RAINING
INSIDE MY OFFICE.

00:01:42.799 --> 00:01:44.409
THAT'S TWO DAYS NOW.

00:01:46.193 --> 00:01:48.152
HAVE YOU TRIED
AN UMBRELLA?

00:01:48.195 --> 00:01:52.069
YOU DO REALIZE I'M
GOING DOWNSTAIRS,
DON'T YOU, CATTERMOLE?

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:53.810
DOWNSTAIRS?

00:01:53.853 --> 00:01:56.769
TO INTERROGATE
YOUR WIFE.

00:01:56.813 --> 00:01:58.249
NOW...

00:01:58.292 --> 00:02:00.730
IF MY WIFE'S BLOOD STATUS
WERE IN DOUBT

00:02:00.773 --> 00:02:04.124
AND THE HEAD OF THE DEPARTMENT
OF MAGICAL LAW ENFORCEMENT

00:02:04.168 --> 00:02:05.604
NEEDED A JOB DOING...

00:02:05.647 --> 00:02:10.261
I THINK I MIGHT JUST
MAKE THAT A PRIORITY.

00:02:10.304 --> 00:02:13.003
YOU HAVE ONE HOUR.

00:02:16.833 --> 00:02:18.356
[ EXHALES SHARPLY ]

00:02:18.399 --> 00:02:20.880
[ RATTLING ]

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:26.930
OH, MY GOD.
WHAT AM I GONNA DO?

00:02:26.973 --> 00:02:30.107
MY WIFE'S
ALL ALONE DOWNSTAIRS.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:33.110
RON, YOU DON'T HAVE
A WIFE.

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:35.155
OH, RIGHT.

00:02:35.199 --> 00:02:37.027
Woman's voice:
LEVEL TWO.

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:40.247
BUT HOW DO I STOP IT
RAINING?

00:02:40.291 --> 00:02:43.294
Hermione:
TRY "FINITE INCANTATEM."[ ELEVATOR DINGS ]

00:02:43.337 --> 00:02:46.645
DEPARTMENT OF MAGICAL LAW
ENFORCEMENT AND IMPROPER
USE OF MAGIC DEPARTMENT.

00:02:46.688 --> 00:02:48.125
THIS IS YOU, RON.

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:50.344
[ RAIN FALLING ]

00:02:52.433 --> 00:02:54.392
FINITE INCANTATEM.

00:02:54.435 --> 00:02:55.697
OKAY.

00:02:55.741 --> 00:02:57.699
AND IF THAT
DOESN'T WORK...

00:02:57.743 --> 00:02:59.614
[ RATTLING ]

00:03:09.799 --> 00:03:12.671
LEVEL ONE, MINISTER OF MAGIC
AND SUPPORT STAFF.

00:03:12.714 --> 00:03:14.891
I'D SAY IF WE DON'T LOCATE
UMBRIDGE WITHIN THE HOUR,

00:03:14.934 --> 00:03:16.762
WE GO FIND RON
AND COME BACK ANOTHER DAY.

00:03:16.806 --> 00:03:18.155
DEAL?
YES.

00:03:20.766 --> 00:03:22.681
AH, MAFALDA.

00:03:22.724 --> 00:03:25.249
TRAVERS SENT YOU, DID HE?
GOOD.

00:03:25.292 --> 00:03:26.946
WE'LL GO
STRAIGHT DOWN.

00:03:29.688 --> 00:03:31.646
ALBERT,
AREN'T YOU GETTING OUT?

00:03:47.401 --> 00:03:49.490
[ RHYTHMIC CLANGING ]

00:04:04.549 --> 00:04:07.465
Pius: RUNCORN.

00:04:07.508 --> 00:04:09.815
[ INDISTINCT TALKING ]

00:04:41.064 --> 00:04:44.154
[ EXPLOSIONS, BANGING,
HORNS HONKING ]

00:04:44.197 --> 00:04:47.766
[ INDISTINCT SHOUTING,
SCREAMING ]

00:04:49.594 --> 00:04:53.598
[ CATS MEOWING ]

00:04:53.641 --> 00:04:59.647
[ EXPLOSIONS, BANGING,
HONKING CONTINUE IN DISTANCE ]

00:04:59.691 --> 00:05:01.475
Accio locket.

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:57.096
Man: [ In distance ]
ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT.

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.359
LET'S CALM DOWN,
SHALL WE?

00:05:59.403 --> 00:06:02.058
LET'S GET BACK TO WORK,
PLEASE.

00:06:02.101 --> 00:06:04.930
[ SIGHS ]
CALM DOWN.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.372
RUNCORN.

00:06:16.811 --> 00:06:18.857
[ ELEVATOR DOOR CLOSES ]

00:06:20.163 --> 00:06:23.035
MORNING.

00:06:23.079 --> 00:06:24.471
RON.

00:06:24.515 --> 00:06:26.125
IT'S ME.

00:06:26.169 --> 00:06:27.387
HARRY!

00:06:27.431 --> 00:06:30.173
BLIMEY, FORGOT
WHAT YOU LOOKED LIKE.

00:06:30.216 --> 00:06:31.783
WHERE'S HERMIONE?

00:06:31.826 --> 00:06:34.699
SHE'S GONE DOWN
TO THE COURTROOMS WITH UMBRIDGE.

00:06:34.742 --> 00:06:36.483
[ RATTLING ]

00:06:41.532 --> 00:06:44.230
Ron: BLOODY COLD
DOWN HERE.

00:06:44.274 --> 00:06:45.971
Alderton:
I'M A HALF-BLOOD.

00:06:46.015 --> 00:06:48.060
MY FATHER --
MY FATHER WAS A WIZARD.

00:06:48.104 --> 00:06:50.584
WILLIAM ALDERTON.
HE WORKED HERE FOR 30 YEARS.

00:06:50.628 --> 00:06:51.933
PERHAPS
YOU KNOW HIM --

00:06:51.977 --> 00:06:53.631
ALWAYS WORE HIS JACKET
INSIDE OUT.

00:06:53.674 --> 00:06:55.981
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]
NO, THERE'S BEEN A MISTAKE.

00:06:56.025 --> 00:06:58.201
LOOK, I'M HALF-BLOOD, YOU SEE.
WE MUST GO BACK.

00:06:58.244 --> 00:06:59.767
I'M HALF-BLOOD.

00:07:05.077 --> 00:07:07.036
[ CLICKING ]

00:07:09.647 --> 00:07:11.301
Umbridge:
MARY ELIZABETH CATTERMOLE?

00:07:11.344 --> 00:07:12.563
Mary: YES.

00:07:12.606 --> 00:07:15.522
OF 27 CHISLEHURST GARDENS,

00:07:15.566 --> 00:07:17.263
GREAT TOLLING, EVESHAM?

00:07:17.307 --> 00:07:19.004
YES.
IT'S HERE.

00:07:19.048 --> 00:07:21.920
MOTHER TO MAISIE, ELLIE,
AND ALFRED?

00:07:21.963 --> 00:07:23.661
WIFE TO REGINALD?

00:07:27.578 --> 00:07:28.970
REG?

